engine/godot/issues/103013","id":4717110991,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGSlmzw","user":{"login":"Shaderd00d","id":9315812,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkzMTU4MTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9315812?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d","html_url":"https://github.com/Shaderd00d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shaderd00d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-16T09:42:15Z","updated_at":"2026-06-16T09:42:15Z","body":"This PR addressed an issue related to numpad emulation that occurred when modifier keys were pressed. That specific issue no longer exists in the current codebase; however, a different issue now causes the same observable behavior.\r\nThe current problem is not limited to the shortcuts used to switch the number and layout of viewports. Other shortcuts such as Q, W, E, and R are affected as well.\r\n\r\nThe description in the issue (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103205) is still accurate, but the root cause now appears to be related to focus handling. If you follow the reproduction steps described in the issue **but move the mouse over the 3D editor**, the shortcuts work as expected.\r\n\r\nI tested this with v4.7.rc.custom_build [6b1004bbe] on the following system:\r\nGodot v4.7.rc2 - Debian GNU/Linux 13 (trixie) 13 on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated Intel(R) UHD Graphics 630 (CFL GT2) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-8850H CPU @ 2.60GHz (12 threads) - 31.11 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, I have not been able to identify and fix the root cause of the issue. Given that this PR does not address the current problem, I think it would make sense to close it.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4717110991/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4774325963","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103013#issuecomment-4774325963","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103013","id":4774325963,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHJJuyw","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-23T00:16:46Z","updated_at":"2026-06-23T00:16:46Z","body":"Closing per the 